00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:45,680
Group One and get a discount voucher.

278
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:51,120
So early version was like, yeah, it could be just, you know, 100% paid in Sweat Coin, just real product.

279
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:57,760
I remember like we secured a deal with our friends at Vivo Barefoot, the flat sole running shoes, very, very cool.

