00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:06,320
And we put them on the marketplace and like, you know, the users were ecstatic.

282
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:13,360
But then obviously as you continue to scale as you go global, it becomes a bit less kind of manageable from a complexity perspective.

283
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:19,120
So we do have discount vouchers, but we also make sure that whatever you can find on Sweat Coin is pretty unique.

