00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:46,320
And so then the value for the brand, like Vivo Barefoot, they give you the shoes, but then essentially it becomes like an ad for them and that the hundred people who tens of thousands of people see Vivo Barefoot and then they go look for, oh, maybe I actually just want to buy this.

290
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:53,840
And then those that get it for free, then maybe over the next decade, they buy ten more pairs of Vivo Barefoot shoes after getting it for free.

