00:21:56,480 --> 00:22:08,960
But when you get a subscription, like, you know, we worked with whatever, Spotify, Apple Music, and this guy's like, you know, basically the proposition is that you can get the first three months for sword coins, and then the rest of it is paid through, you know, fiat or cash.

