00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:34,880
And there were lots of, you know, without traffic, lots of new startups doing some really cool things in the health and wellness space, like, you know, innovative kind of wearable sensors, apparel and stuff like that.

310
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:40,800
And they would just, you know, they would always struggle with distribution because, you know, you do when you start from scratch.

