00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:51,040
And we would be that kind of really, really welcome partner for them because we would be just showcasing their product to our user base and the user base would was very tuned and receptive to this, and it was just great.

312
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,800
Yeah, that's so fascinating.

